      92.0,
      284.83,
      310.51,
      345.97
    ],
    "text": "(1) in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for the words and figures \"With effect from May 1, 2015,\", of the words and figures \"For the period commencing on May 1, 2015 and ending on March 31, 2025, ''; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      92.0,
      356.83,
      310.52,
      417.97
    ],
    "text": "(2) in subsection (2) thereof, by the substitution for the words \"commencing from January 1, 2016\", of the words \"for the period commencing on January 1, 2016 and ending on March 31, 2025,\".",
